{
  "title": { "zh": "引理也是证明项" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "证过的引理在证明项里写成它的名字：用了<part-ref to=\"lemma:chain\"></part-ref>，证明项里就是 chain p q。名字背后是证出它的那个证明项。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "t-lemma_1",
      "kind": "proof",
      "terms": true,
      "step": { "zh": "用串联" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "A → B", "q": "B → C" }, "goal": "A → C", "term": "chain p q" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wet", "C": "Slip" }, { "A": "Alarm", "B": "Up", "C": "OnTime" }],
      "briefNote": { "zh": "证明项须为 chain p q。" },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "一张<part-ref to=\"lemma:chain\"></part-ref>就够。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["c = chain(p, q)", "goal <- c"]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-lemma_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "terms": true,
      "step": { "zh": "不用串联" },
      "without": ["chain"],
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "A → B", "q": "B → C" }, "goal": "A → C", "term": "fun h => q (p h)" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain", "B": "Wet", "C": "Slip" }, { "A": "Alarm", "B": "Up", "C": "OnTime" }],
      "briefNote": {
        "zh": "不用<part-ref to=\"lemma:chain\"></part-ref>，证明项须为 fun h => q (p h)。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "当初证<part-ref to=\"lemma:chain\"></part-ref>时接的是什么？"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "f = impI[A=A](body: m2) {",
        "  body {",
        "    m1 = mp(p, f.body)",
        "    m2 = mp(q, m1)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "goal <- f"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
